  "question": "What's the closest beach resort positioned towards the northeast of Red Wolf Sanctuary, Rising Sun, IN?",
  "sql": "\nWITH origin AS (SELECT ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-84.875376 38.951571)',4326)::geography AS geometry)\nSELECT * FROM pois,origin\nWHERE pois.leisure = 'beach_resort'\nAND degrees(ST_Azimuth(origin.geometry, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN 22.5 AND 67.5\nORDER BY pois.geometry <-> origin.geometry ASC\nLIMIT 1;\n",
